<p>Curses your target, preventing normal life regeneration and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">406, 547, 655, 748, 830</acronym> darkness damage over 10 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>